# "Return a land you control to its owner's hand" may name the Carnarium itself.
# Bot1 returns the Carnarium on turn three, keeping its Swamp, and plays it again on turn five (its land play for that turn), returning
# the Swamp this time. On turn seven, the Swamp played again, the Carnarium and the Swamp tap for {B}{R} and {B}: three mana from two lands.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Rakdos Carnarium
Swamp x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Rakdos Carnarium.Play
Bot1.Choose(Rakdos Carnarium)
? Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Rakdos Carnarium.Play
Bot1.Choose(Swamp)
? Bot1.Battlefield = Rakdos Carnarium
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Rakdos Carnarium.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {B}{B}{R}

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Rakdos Carnarium; Swamp
